{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"build123d","tool":"list_mcp_resources","arguments":{"server":"build123d"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"resources\":[{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://quickref\",\"name\":\"build123d_quickref\",\"description\":\"build123d API quick reference: primitives, booleans, positioning, sketch-to-3D, selectors, fillets.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://selectors\",\"name\":\"build123d_selectors_cookbook\",\"description\":\"Task-indexed cookbook of selector patterns: get the top face, find circular edges, filter by area/length/radius, Select.LAST in builder context, fillet detection, and the operator shortcuts.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://drafting\",\"name\":\"build123d_drafting_cookbook\",\"description\":\"DEPRECATED (#465) — moving to draftwright (https://github.com/pzfreo/draftwright), which owns drawing generation and publishes its own skill; importable inside execute(). Code-first 2D engineering drawings cookbook: project a 3D part to a 2D view, dimension with ExtensionLine/DimensionLine, add tolerances, compose a TechnicalDrawing title block, multi-view sheet layout, hole-table pattern, export to DXF/SVG.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://drafting-api\",\"name\":\"build123d_drafting_api\",\"description\":\"DEPRECATED (#465) — moving to draftwright (https://github.com/pzfreo/draftwright), which owns drawing generation and publishes its own skill; importable inside execute(). Auto-generated API reference for build123d-drafting-helpers: exact signatures and one-line descriptions for every public class (Dimension, Leader, TitleBlock, Drawing, ...) and function, generated from the installed library so it always matches what execute() imports.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://presentation\",\"name\":\"build123d_presentation_cookbook\",\"description\":\"Code-first design-discussion diagrams: per-group colour via ExportSVG layers, filled feature highlights, legends with swatches, reference axes, titles, and Draft scaling for small parts. Presentation diagrams are NOT engineering drawings and are unaffected by the drawing deprecation (#465); this resource stays.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://session\",\"name\":\"build123d_session_state\",\"description\":\"Live session state: current shape diagnostics, named objects, snapshots, and user-defined variables.\",\"mimeType\":\"application/json\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://bd_warehouse\",\"name\":\"build123d_bd_warehouse\",\"description\":\"Catalogue of pre-built parametric parts in bd_warehouse: bearings, fasteners, gears, pipes, threads, and more.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://skill/drawing\",\"name\":\"build123d_drawing_skill\",\"description\":\"DEPRECATED (#465) — moving to draftwright (https://github.com/pzfreo/draftwright), which owns drawing generation and publishes its own skill; importable inside execute(). The b123d-drawing engineering workflow skill: step-by-step guide for creating multi-view engineering drawings from build123d geometry (views, scale, annotation, lint, SVG/DXF/PDF export).\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://skill/modeling\",\"name\":\"build123d_modeling_skill\",\"description\":\"The b123d-modeling workflow skill: step-by-step guide for building 3D parts and assemblies with build123d via this server — including extracting a spec from a technical drawing, the incremental build/measure/render loop, dominant-form correction after the first render, snapshots, and export.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://skill/edit\",\"name\":\"build123d_edit_skill\",\"description\":\"The b123d-edit workflow skill: modify existing build123d source code explicitly, then verify geometry deltas, fit, validity, and export-gate results with build123d-mcp.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"},{\"server\":\"build123d\",\"uri\":\"build123d://skill/repair\",\"name\":\"build123d_repair_skill\",\"description\":\"The b123d-repair workflow skill: diagnose a validity-gate failure with validate()/export()/locate_gate_defects(), then write explicit build123d/OCP repair code in execute() using field-proven patterns, snapshots, and export-gate verification.\",\"mimeType\":\"text/plain\"}]}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
